    "hlt_problem": {
      "type": "hlt-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Most snacks packed for a day out are a compromise.",
            "size": "hlt-h2"
          }
        },
        "body_2": {
          "type": "body",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Parents in Singapore say it plainly: \"These are basically junk food tbh but they have their uses.\" You pack them anyway, because a hungry toddler halfway round the zoo will not wait.</p>",
            "large": true
          }
        },
        "body_3": {
          "type": "body",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Then the open bag rolls around at the bottom of the stroller, goes soft, and ends up in the bin. One parent put it this way: other brands \"always got wasted because they couldn't keep.\"</p>",
            "large": true
          }
        },
        "body_4": {
          "type": "body",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>The fault sits with the snack you had to settle for, not with you.</strong></p>",
            "large": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_1",
        "body_2",
        "body_3",
        "body_4"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "layout": "split",
        "width": "wide",
        "background": "cream",
        "sparkles": false,
        "wave_top": false,
        "wave_top_color": "paper",
        "wave_bottom": false,
        "wave_bottom_color": "paper",
        "padding_top": 56,
        "padding_bottom": 56
      }
    },
    "hlt_belief": {
      "type": "hlt-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "A snack for the bag can be one you are happy to give.",
            "size": "hlt-h2"
          }
        },
        "body_2": {
          "type": "body",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Three questions decide it. Can your child eat it easily at the age they are now? Are you happy with what is in it? Will it still be good when you open it at four in the afternoon?</p>",
            "large": true
          }
        },
        "body_3": {
          "type": "body",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Yummybara was made to answer yes to all three.</strong></p>",
            "large": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_1",
        "body_2",
        "body_3"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "layout": "card",
        "width": "narrow",
        "background": "splash-pale",
        "sparkles": true,
